{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:59:06+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Puzzle Pirates", "steam_appid": 99910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the World of Puzzle Pirates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Pirates is a complete pirate world powered by puzzles.  Every activity in Puzzle Pirates is a unique challenge: Try your hand at sailing, gunning, hauling treasure, and many more as you voyage across a vast ocean filled with treasure, mysterious Brigand Kings, and monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn booty and start trading, build a trading empire, and end up governor of your own island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/ba50984ca80a0acd5f3fa44dcf84e06e.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail the seas with your friends and pillage brigands and merchants aboard your very own pirate ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/7287c84a820f7ad9ea0dfcbee7103125.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play more than 20 puzzles and mini-games, representing various piratey exploits, from swordfighting and sailing to shipbuilding, foraging, and digging up buried treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/38bdbefb32c645a868d8052c5f5899e3.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa