s/ba50984ca80a0acd5f3fa44dcf84e06e.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail the seas with your friends and pillage brigands and merchants aboard your very own pirate ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/7287c84a820f7ad9ea0dfcbee7103125.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play more than 20 puzzles and mini-games, representing various piratey exploits, from swordfighting and sailing to shipbuilding, foraging, and digging up buried treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/38bdbefb32c645a868d8052c5f5899e3.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living world filled with thousands of other players! Hunt dangerous Sea Monsters and voyage to lost treasure-filled realms, such as the Haunted Seas or the Cursed Isles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/b671c9ad811ce4a7101269ba09a7ae6c.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pirate with a bounty of different clothing items and equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/99910/extras/3f5f2d3dff0b710a105003deccf175ac.avif?t=1788985222\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own shop and produce weapo